1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,450
In 1963 in Türkiye, a man was fixing his house and knocked down a wall.

2
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:08,400
Behind that wall was a tunnel with no end in sight.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,800
It was a huge underground city, going 85 m down.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,250
People dug into soft volcanic rock and made rooms, floor by floor.

5
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:19,450
About 20,000 people could hide here, with their animals.

6
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:23,250
Air shafts go up to the surface and bring air deep down.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:28,050
The doors were round stones of hundreds of kg, and could only be rolled from inside.

8
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:31,600
When enemies came, the whole city disappeared underground.
